  (text "POWER -- 12.6 V from P1 and 5 V from USB-C -- diode-OR, buck, LDO" (at 30 388 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "00244c5c-a4c6-4f02-92a7-3cb7537a9ef1"))
  (text "LOGIC -- machine interface, level stage, ESP32, both expanders" (at 30 28 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "cc007f6b-04a7-4670-aee4-2e856bf87b64"))
  (text "PANEL -- the 11 lamps: 8 sourced by the panel expander, 3 sunk by it" (at 600 28 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "d3a2fcd3-e365-4044-b299-fa3ec46e6f05"))
  (text "AUDIO -- I2S class-D amp and the speaker" (at 600 348 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "771c25ba-d1ab-4480-8d76-778917374476"))
  (text "wifi-comm-pac Rev A - O1NEXT WiFi COMM PAC (issues #324, #325, part of #56)" (at 30 545 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "37ce5512-aa7e-468a-bef5-c4af7289357f"))
  (text "J1 is a 2x5 IDC: pin n = DE-9 pin n for 1..9; pin 10 is spare." (at 30 551 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a012873b-b9ba-43c7-a8f4-aaa1519a379a"))
  (text "Pin 7 is +12.6 V DC direct from the machine (2.02 A rail), NOT via R21." (at 30 557 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a32c41ea-1fa8-40b0-bb85-43d31b64021e"))
  (text "U1/U2 translate the 5 V TTL side; U3 is the open-drain MSB sink." (at 30 563 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "5b8014ab-deea-4bf8-a51a-ca98ba572713"))
  (text "U4 MAX3232 runs on 3V3 so its drivers swing +/-5.5 V into the bipolar RXD." (at 30 569 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "ca850bb5-2759-4a43-8547-99d4faebb082"))
  (text "U6 = panel expander 0x58 (P0 push-pull CC, P1 open-drain). U7 = handshake 0x59." (at 30 575 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "e5738f28-fc15-4d78-8eeb-909267a89c40"))
  (text "Both expanders are fitted: neither is full, so the pin budget is closed." (at 30 581 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "685ec26f-cea7-4622-b108-34a03775d8b9"))
  (text "Power is diode-OR: 12.6 V -> 5 V path, and USB-C 5 V for bench work." (at 30 587 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "f7221220-c9f9-469a-9261-bb5e0e935cc7"))
